OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor resigns over group
OL,4,Amisogyny allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe main opposition group on
OL,7,FOxfordshire County Council has lost its
OL,8,Fposition after a councillor resigned
OL,9,Fover concerns about alleged misogyny
OL,10,Fand bullying within the group.
OL,12,FIndependent Paul-Austin Sargent, who
OL,13,Frepresents Banbury, said the issue was
OL,14,Fthe "main reason" he had left the
OL,15,FOxfordshire Alliance after allegations
OL,16,Fabout the treatment of female
OL,17,Fcouncillors raised at a meeting last
OL,18,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
