OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor resigns over group
OL,4,Amisogyny allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlliance leader Liam Walker strongly
OL,7,Frejected any suggestion the group had
OL,8,Fengaged in bullying, misogyny or
OL,9,Fracism.
OL,11,FSargent's resignation came after former
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat councillor, Dr Lidia
OL,13,FArciszewska, listed several times when
OL,14,Fshe said female politicians had been
OL,15,Fverbally abused by councillors, "some
OL,16,Fof whom sit in this very chamber," with
OL,17,Fno action being taken by the council.
